    "detailed_description": "This is a very interesting puzzle game. The game is simple, the interface is generous and concise, and the process is simple and interesting. Press the mouse and follow the arrows to complete the writing stroke by stroke. The toolbar provides different colored pencils for each player, and during this process, you can freely choose the color of the pencil for writing. The wisdom of letters awaits every player to obtain. In levels such as 26 English letters and Arabic numerals, players constantly upgrade. While passing through levels, they also help players learn and understand letters, numbers, and words through educational and entertainment methods. You always receive comments after writing, let's see if you can always' do it well '!",
